Day-3: 
    - Globbing 
    - Notations 
                Basic globbing:      *  ?  [...] [[:  :]] [^ ] [! ] 
                Extended globbing:   ?()  *()  +()  @()  !()   [Next Class]
                Recursive globbing:  **                        [Next Class]
                Brace expansion:     {a,b}  {1..10} 
   
  Refer: 
  man bash
  man 7 glob 
  blog: https://www.linuxjournal.com/content/bash-extended-globbing

  Explore: 
  shopt  --------> shell options 
  
  To check globbing is enabled or not 
  shopt extglob

  To enable ** 
  shopt -s globstar
  ls **/*.txt

  To check what are the other shell options 
  shopt 
  
  To set -s 
  To unset -u 
  
  More on shopt: help shopt

  Examples: 
  ls *.@(txt|pdf)
  ls *.!(gif|jpg) 

  ls +(a).txt



